## Decisions and Action Items

1. **`draft-ietf-jose-hpke-pq-pqt`**:
   * The chairs will issue a Working Group Last Call (WGLC) for approximately 3 to 4 weeks to accommodate the holiday period.
   * Following WGLC completion, the WG will evaluate requesting early IANA registrations in early January.

2. **`draft-ietf-jose-pq-composite-sigs`**:
   * Authors will finalize the algorithm combination list, ensuring JOSE-specific requirements are explicitly validated, and prepare the document for WGLC.

3. **`draft-ietf-jose-jwp-modular-bbs` & JWP Family**:
   * Authors of `draft-ietf-jose-jwp-modular-bbs`, `draft-ietf-jose-json-web-proof`, and `draft-ietf-jose-json-proof-token` will coordinate offline to align key binding mechanisms and evaluate requirements for CBOR / SD-CWT representations.